      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Aggregates Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Counting and NULLs",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Call",
                "Result"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`COUNT(*)`",
                  "all rows"
                ],
                [
                  "`COUNT(col)`",
                  "{green:non-NULL} values"
                ],
                [
                  "`COUNT(DISTINCT col)`",
                  "unique non-NULL values"
                ],
                [
                  "`SUM` `AVG` `MIN` `MAX`",
                  "{red:skip NULLs}"
                ],
                [
                  "Empty input",
                  "NULL, except `COUNT` gives ==0=="
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. WHERE vs HAVING",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "FROM",
                    "ink": "black"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "WHERE",
                    "sub": "filters rows",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "GROUP BY",
                    "sub": "buckets",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HAVING",
                    "sub": "filters groups",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "SELECT",
                    "ink": "black"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Select list columns: in ==GROUP BY== or inside an aggregate (portable rule)",
                "Aggregates are fine in `HAVING`, never in `WHERE`",
                "Plain conditions go in `WHERE`: less data to group"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Conditional Aggregate",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==SUM(CASE WHEN cond THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)== counts the rows matching cond"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "sql",
              "lines": [
                "SELECT dept, COUNT(*) AS n,",
                "  SUM(CASE WHEN active = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS act",
                "FROM emp GROUP BY dept HAVING COUNT(*) > 5;"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why does AVG differ from SUM/COUNT(*)?** AVG divides by `COUNT(col)`; NULL rows leave the denominator.",
                "**When HAVING over WHERE?** When the test uses an aggregate; row-level tests go in WHERE."
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
